s requested privacy.  Appropriate efforts are made to provide advance notice to the registered guest before entering an occupied guestroom.</li>  </ul></p><p>Special Instructions : It is Hyatt s practice to enter any occupied guestroom at a minimum of once within a 24-hour period, even if a guest has requested privacy. Appropriate efforts are made to provide advance notice to the registered guest before entering an occupied guestroom.To make arrangements for check-in please contact the property ahead of time using the information on the booking confirmation. If you are planning to arrive after midnight please contact the property in advance using the information on the booking confirmation. Guests must contact the property in advance for check-in instructions. Front desk staff will greet guests on arrival.</p>', '2220 W Mills Cir GrapevineTexas 76051 ', 386, 3);
